<Project Sdk="AsmFoundation.Sdk">
  <!--
    The GrpcAsm engine: HTTP/2 (h2n), HPACK (hpack), the epoll worker (worker), the per-worker
    allocator (pool), structured logging (log) and helpers (util), moved out of KvAsm
    (AsmFoundation/KvAsm server/src at 60d7e81) unchanged.

    Milestone B: step 1 split the files, step 2 renamed the engine's exports to ga_*, and step 3
    made the application hooks the only way the engine calls out: the ga_app_* symbols declared
    and documented in include/grpcasm_hooks.inc, which an application (samples/KvServer) defines
    and the linker binds when it links this library. The next steps move the generic half of
    KvAsm's grpc.asm in here and replace the fixed routes with route tables (docs/ROADMAP.md).
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>StaticLibrary</OutputType>
    <AsmLibraryName>grpcasm</AsmLibraryName>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
